## Snapshot Runner
The snapshot suite is exercised by:

- `snapshots/run.js`

This runner:

- loads each snapshot  
- executes RTT/1  
- compares live output to mock output  
- prints pass/fail diff surfaces  

It is deterministic and CI‑safe.

